D TODAY THE LAUNCH OF MOBILE AND RETAIL SPORTS BETTING OPERATIONS IN OHIO. FANS ACROSS THE BUCKEYE STATE NOW HAVE ACCESS TO THE BETMGM MOBILE APP AND CAN ALSO PLACE WAGERS WITHIN BETMGM'S RETAIL SPORTSBOOKS LOCATED AT MGM NORTHFIELD PARK AND THE GREAT AMERICAN BALL PARK."}{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2023-01-03 07:00:00', 'title': 'MODERNA TO PROVIDE BUSINESS AND PIPELINE UPDATES AT THE 2023 J.P. MORGAN HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MA / ACCESSWIRE / JANUARY 3, 2023 / MODERNA, INC. (NASDAQ:MRNA), A BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY PIONEERING MESSENGER RNA (MRNA) THERAPEUTICS AND VACCINES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CEO STÉPHANE BANCEL WILL PRESENT AN UPDATE ON THE COMPANY AND ITS PIPELINE OF MRNA DEVELOPMENT PROGRAMS AT THE 41ST ANNUAL J.P. MORGAN HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE ON MONDAY, JANUARY 9TH AT 5:15 P.M.'}{'symbol': 'MOH', 'date': '2023-01-03 06:30:00', 'title': 'MOLINA HEALTHCARE PROJECTS ITS CALIFORNIA MEDICAID REVENUE WILL DOUBLE UNDER REVISED MEDI-CAL CONTRACT AWARDS', 'text': 'LONG BEACH, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MOLINA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE: MOH) (“MOLINA”) CONFIRMED TODAY THAT THE CALIFORNIA DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH CARE SERVICES (“DHCS”) HAS ANNOUNCED THE AWARDS OF MEDI-CAL CONTRACTS TO MOLINA HEALTHCARE OF CALIFORNIA COMMENCING ON JANUARY 1, 2024.'}{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2023-01-02 02:08:00', 'title': 'DHAKA STOCK EXCHANGE EXTENDS TECHNOLOGY PARTNERSHIP WITH NASDAQ', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND DHAKA, BANGLADESH, JAN. 02, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DHAKA STOCK EXCHANGE (DSE) AND NASDAQ (NASDAQ: NDAQ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE EXTENSION OF THEIR PARTNERSHIP WHERE NASDAQ PROVIDES DSE WITH TRADING TECHNOLOGY. THE AGREEMENT INCLUDES AN UPGRADE OF NASDAQ´S X-STREAM INET TECHNOLOGY IN ORDER TO ACCOMMODATE THE INCREASING TRADING ACTIVITY OF THE EXCHANGE WITH MAINTAINED MARKET RESILIENCY AND INVESTOR INTEGRITY.'}{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2023-01-03 09:05:00', 'title': 'NEW NUCOR STEEL BRANDENBURG PLATE MILL ROLLS FIRST PLATE', 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C. , JAN. 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE